  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">깊은 수준은 아니지만 디지털 센서인 이지메이커를 활용해 데이터를 수집하고 해석하는 활동을 해봤습니다.<br>&#160;<br>안내자료<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cw4ZsJS4UWzED6Bjs8fG1UEQpfEVCxrMYyuwhhBDHkw/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cw4ZsJS4UWzED6Bjs8fG1UEQpfEVCxrMYyuwhhBDHkw/edit?usp=drivesdk</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cw4ZsJS4UWzED6Bjs8fG1UEQpfEVCxrMYyuwhhBDHkw/edit?usp=drivesdk\" data-og-url=\"\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cw4ZsJS4UWzED6Bjs8fG1UEQpfEVCxrMYyuwhhBDHkw/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cw4ZsJS4UWzED6Bjs8fG1UEQpfEVCxrMYyuwhhBDHkw/edit?usp=drivesdk\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\"></p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\"></p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>&#160;<br>1차시: 센서 사용법 익히기, 사용할 센서 선정<br>2차시: 계획서 작성<br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"센서 데이터 기반 현상 탐구(모둠별 계획서) - Google Drive\" data-og-description=\"이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요. 닫기\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1crU55H_a-344mrVGWjyf_O71H-1b27mv43PeHh99nzCwp0Ha1ScBZlvxgwIrbtitwhjEf9Ag?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">센서 데이터 기반 현상 탐구(모둠별 계획서) - Google Drive</p><p class=\"og-desc\">이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요. 닫기</p><p class=\"og-host\">drive.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3차시: 실험 수행 1차<br>4차시: 실험 수행 2차<br>5차시: 보고서 작성(종이 보고서를 받았는데 양식이 어디에 갔는지... 그래프 해석, 가설과 비교, 소감 등으로 간단히 1페이지 작성)<br>그래프 그리기 (구글 시트)<br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"조별 그래프 제출 - Google Drive\" data-og-description=\"1512엄태진,1521최우진,1522최정후,1525하태준\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OsvCom8fOSaJxomUgVz2-GDPIu4nOdoo_Acefmi7kJ1ys_Odgrd-EsllxwsU93ZnBNGnG9AP?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">조별 그래프 제출 - Google Drive</p><p class=\"og-desc\">1512엄태진,1521최우진,1522최정후,1525하태준</p><p class=\"og-host\">drive.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f8bc6f8a0941e74e02f9f8e71acd4ac0cced8f06\" data-file-name=\"20260225_161842.jpg\" data-file-size=\"3942155\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D433%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260201000552&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ff8bc6f8a0941e74e02f9f8e71acd4ac0cced8f06')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">20260225_161842</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.76MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">7개 세트 구비: 온습도센서,수중접촉온도센서,접촉온도센서,기압센서,미니보드,PC연결선,센서연견선 4개<br><br>교사용 센서 풀키트 하나 구비+ C-C타입 연결선 6개 추가 구입(갤럭시 휴대폰 또는 패드와 연결)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a809ebabc39b4647786ac3a41ab5e4f73353fbde\" data-file-name=\"20260225_161607.jpg\" data-file-size=\"3921071\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D433%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260201000552&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa809ebabc39b4647786ac3a41ab5e4f73353fbde')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">20260225_161607</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.74MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>일부 센서 추가 구비<br>밝기, 자이로, 미세먼지, 가스, 이산화탄소<br>전압, 전류, 자기장</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a8210ca25f5b19d7e5d3085bdaff42848a766fe\" data-file-name=\"20260225_161658.jpg\" data-file-size=\"3957929\" data-mimetype=\"image/jpeg\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DcTdL%26dataid%3D433%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20260201000552&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7a8210ca25f5b19d7e5d3085bdaff42848a766fe')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">20260225_161658</span><span class=\"type\">.jpg</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.77MB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
